  "message_id": "SEL_TALK003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}我要在最上面！{F5 47 02 01 02 01 0D 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_190.bf.json:3:2",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}都站到我身上来{F5 47 02 01 02 01 0D 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_190.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}好嘞！　那大家尽管往我身上来吧！\n不管来多少人，\n我都做好一起接住的准备了！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_190.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}我说啊……\n就是因为你这种用词，\n才会惹出各种误会吧！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_190.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}啊？　什么意思啊？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_190.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 05 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}……算了。\n对你每句话都插……插嘴纠正，\n搞得好像是我很在意似的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_190.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}……？\n花村学长真敏感啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_190.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 05 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}{F5 C1 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}所以说，注意用词！\n你的词典怎么净是这种词啊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_190.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}啊，不好意思打断你的兴头，\n不过看体型，最上面只能是小熊吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_190.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 21 01 01 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0C 01}嗯～，对不起啦老师。\n小熊是柔弱纤细的美少年，\n注定要站在顶点熊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_190.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}好好好，快把玩偶服穿上。\n这样被你踩也稍微软和点。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_190.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0E 01}学长，真是条汉子！！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_190.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_014",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0F 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}不，最下面还是完二吧。\n你再怎么厉害也会被压扁的。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_190.bf.json:15:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_015",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 10 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}真的假的！？\n算了，被学长踩我也不会生气，\n没问题。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e110_190.bf.json:16:0",
